  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nEquation solved with the help of the BODMAS Rule.\n\nLet's check the options one by one.\n\n**Option 1) **÷, +, ×, +, =\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷ 33**__ + 66 × 22 + 44 = 50\n\n⇒ 3 + __**66 × 22**__ + 44 = 50\n\n⇒ __**3 + 1452 + 44**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 1499 ≠ 50 (Incorrect)\n\n**Option 2) **+, -, ÷, -, =\n\n⇒ 99 + 33 - __**66 ÷ 22**__ - 44 = 50\n\n⇒ __**99 + 33**__ - 3 - 44 = 50\n\n⇒ 132 __**- 3 - 44 **__= 50\n\n⇒ 132 - 47 = 50\n\n⇒ 85 ≠ 50 (Incorrect)\n\n**Option 3) **÷, +, ÷, +, =\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷ 33**__ + __**66 ÷ 22**__ + 44 = 50\n\n⇒ __**3 + 3 + 44**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 50 = 50 (Correct)\n\n**Option 4) **÷, -, +, ×, =\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷ 33**__ - 66 + 22 × 44 = 50\n\n⇒ 3 - 66 + __**22 × 44**__ = 50\n\n⇒ __**3**__ - 66 __**+ 968 **__= 50\n\n⇒ 971 - 66 = 50\n\n⇒ 905 ≠ 50 (Incorrect)\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"÷, +, ÷, +, =\".**",
